App icons (PWA manifest icons + favicon)
========================================

Files: icon.svg icon-maskable.svg icon-192.png icon-512.png
       icon-maskable-512.png apple-touch-icon-180.png
       favicon-16.png favicon-32.png
       ../favicon.svg ../favicon.ico

Composition
-----------
The rounded background, the accent underline and the layout are original to this
project; colours come from `src/theme.ts`.

The knight glyph is the **cburnett** white-knight outline (`public/pieces/wN.svg`),
reused unmodified in geometry and recoloured for a dark background:
white fill -> #e9d7b8 (board light), black strokes/details -> #14181d (page background).

