How the PNGs were produced
--------------------------
The two SVGs are the sources of truth. The PNGs were rasterised by rendering each
SVG in headless Chrome and screenshotting at the target size — no image-processing
dependency was added to the project. `favicon.ico` is a 16+32 px container whose
payload is those two PNG files verbatim (PNG-in-ICO, read by every current browser).
